{{!
    @template tiny_studiolms/block_widget

    The block of a widget of the StudioLMS widgets filter: only the marker the filter replaces when the page is shown.
    In the editor and in the Studio the stylesheet draws the marker as a dashed box; on a page it is hidden, so a
    marker the filter does not replace (the filter was turned off) shows nothing instead of the text of the marker.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "widget": "coursemap",
        "marker": "[COURSEMAP current=progress]"
    }
}}
<div class="slms-block slms-widget-block slms-widget-{{widget}}"><span class="slms-widget-marker">{{marker}}</span></div>
